1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,909
The letter arrived on a quiet Sunday morning.

2
00:00:02,909 --> 00:00:05,818
I opened it slowly, expecting nothing at all.

3
00:00:05,938 --> 00:00:11,487
And then I saw it: we had won! After all those years, we had actually won!

4
00:00:11,607 --> 00:00:15,855
But by the time I ran to tell her, the house was empty,

5
00:00:15,855 --> 00:00:18,635
and the only answer was the silence.
